# Local, machine-specific buck2 configuration (remote-execution endpoint). Never committed.
.buckconfig.local
buck-out/
# The buck2 binary: fetch the pinned release in tools/buck2 (see README.md).
/buck2
__pycache__/
# The caches of the zig actions that run in local mode: they write to their working directory, which is the checkout (rules/zig/zig.bzl, zig_bootstrap_exe). On the farm they are
# in the worker's own directory. publish_unpack refuses a tree with an untracked file, so this one is listed on purpose.
.zig-cache/
